Dear Vigil AI Research Team,

I am reaching out from the OpenResearch Institute to propose a collaborative study
on AI safety benchmarks for containment systems.

We are compiling a benchmark dataset to evaluate how well various containment
architectures detect prompt injection and behavioral anomalies. Given Vigil AI's
focus in this area, we believe a collaboration could be mutually beneficial.

We propose:
1. A joint dataset contribution (anonymized attack samples)
2. Co-authored benchmark evaluation paper
3. Shared results under Creative Commons license

Please let me know if you are interested in exploring this further. I am happy
to schedule a call at your convenience.

Best regards,
Dr. Priya Sharma
